            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Smoother wallpaper control.</h3><p>VoxelWall 1.0.34 makes it easier to fine-tune a wallpaper after it is active. You can switch between Subtle, Balanced, Intense, and Energy Saver, then apply the new setting without restarting setup.</p><p>This update also improves reliability when the latest wallpaper version takes over on your desktop and Lock Screen.</p>]]></description>
